{
  "id": "assets",
  "capability": "Assets",
  "description": "Asset records and content: the asset service and query adapters, asset and media-asset schemas, the model asset browser, model upload and import wizard, media assets sidebar panel, media asset actions (download, delete, zip and node-output export, drag), and the asset, download, export, and sidebar-badge stores. Queue and job stores, model-to-node mapping, missing-media and missing-model scans, the litegraph widget base, node widgets that render asset dropdowns, the agent composer asset tray, workflow sharing, and the queue media lightbox remain with their owning domains.",
