  "compatibilityPromises": [
    "External callers use explicit portable package entries or characterized application modules. Internal implementation files are not supported imports.",
    "Portable asset data operations have no dependency on application state, authenticated transport, framework state, editor classes, or browser objects.",
    "Application adapters retain queue, workflow, model-provider, dialog, and graph dependencies without transferring those responsibilities into assets.",
    "Grouped display identity remains distinct from asset-record and stored-content identity. Consolidation preserves existing asset lifecycle and extension widget behavior."
